config BR2_PACKAGE_AIC8800_FIRMWARE
	bool "aic8800-firmware"
	help
	  AIC8800D80 U02 Bluetooth and SDIO Wi-Fi firmware from
	  linux-firmware, installed where the aic8800 driver loads it.
	  The driver's transmit-power configuration is installed by the
	  aic8800 package.

	  https://gitlab.com/kernel-firmware/linux-firmware
